igned surveys show the gap narrowing, and outside figures have rallied to Lahn in the final stretch. Water quality, cancer concerns, and cost of living dominate the closing argument. The forecast expects Sand to win by a mid-single-digit margin, with meaningful residual uncertainty.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.8753, "margin": 5.7}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.8859, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.8669, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.8657, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.8472, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.8297, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.8734, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.8592, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.8769, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.8877, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.8875, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.895, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.8938, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.8853, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.8878, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.8885, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9358, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9281, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9084, "margin": 7.2}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9164, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9294, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.921, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9021, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.9297, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.88, "margin": 6.3}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.8829, "margin": 6.3}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.8829, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-19", "p_dem": 0.8752, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-20", "p_dem": 0.8797, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-21", "p_dem": 0.8697, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-22", "p_